msgid "WooCommerce POS Pro is now standalone."
msgstr "WooCommerce POS Pro kini berdiri sendiri."

msgid ""
"The Pro plugin includes all features from the free version. You can safely "
"deactivate and delete this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Plugin Pro termasuk semua ciri dari versi percuma. Anda boleh nyahaktif dan "
"padam plugin ini dengan selamat."

